{"seq":3,"slug":"listwise-objectives","title":"列表级目标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reranking-retrieval-models/training/listwise-objectives","wordCount":1404,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"列表级目标\">列表级目标</h1><p>Pairwise 损失有个致命盲区：它平等惩罚所有错位。把真正的第 1 名和第 2 名排反，与把第 1 名和第 50 名排反，RankNet 给的损失一样大——可前者只是小瑕疵，后者是灾难。问题的根源在于评测指标 nDCG/MRR 只在乎排序顶部，而 pairwise 损失对位置一视同仁。列表级目标（listwise objectives）就是为弥合这道「训练损失 vs 评测指标」的裂缝而生：它一次看整条候选列表，让优化方向直接对准排序质量。这是 <a href=\"training-rerankers\">重排器训练</a> 三范式里数学最重、与 <a href=\"../practice/reranking-evaluation\">nDCG/MRR</a> 最对齐的一档。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从成对到列表\">核心概念：从成对到列表</h2><p>把视野从「一对文档」放大到「整条列表」，能捕捉成对损失看不见的全局结构。给定查询 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 的候选列表，模型输出一组分数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{s_1,\\dots,s_n\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，列表级损失直接拿这组分数和理想排序比，优化整条列表的质量。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[Pointwise&lt;br/&gt;1 文档&lt;br/&gt;绝对相关度] --&gt; B[Pairwise&lt;br/&gt;2 文档&lt;br/&gt;相对顺序 但错位等权]&#10;  B --&gt; C[Listwise&lt;br/&gt;整条列表&lt;br/&gt;对齐 nDCG 顶部加权]&#10;  C --&gt; D1[ListNet&lt;br/&gt;概率分布对齐]&#10;  C --&gt; D2[LambdaRank&lt;br/&gt;按 nDCG 增益加权梯度]&#10;  C --&gt; D3[Softmax/InfoNCE&lt;br/&gt;对比式列表损失]\">flowchart TD\n  A[Pointwise&lt;br/&gt;1 文档&lt;br/&gt;绝对相关度] --&gt; B[Pairwise&lt;br/&gt;2 文档&lt;br/&gt;相对顺序 但错位等权]\n  B --&gt; C[Listwise&lt;br/&gt;整条列表&lt;br/&gt;对齐 nDCG 顶部加权]\n  C --&gt; D1[ListNet&lt;br/&gt;概率分布对齐]\n  C --&gt; D2[LambdaRank&lt;br/&gt;按 nDCG 增益加权梯度]\n  C --&gt; D3[Softmax/InfoNCE&lt;br/&gt;对比式列表损失]</pre><p>三条主流列表级路线各有侧重：ListNet 把排序转成概率分布去匹配；LambdaRank/LambdaMART 给成对梯度乘上「交换这两个文档会让 nDCG 变多少」的权重；softmax 交叉熵（含 InfoNCE 风格）把正例当多分类目标。下面分别讲。</p>\n<h2 id=\"listnet-把排序变成概率分布\">ListNet：把排序变成概率分布</h2><p>ListNet 的思路是把「一个排序」转成「一个概率分布」，再让模型分布逼近理想分布。用 top-1 概率（Plackett-Luce 简化）定义：文档 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 排第一的概率正比于其分数的指数。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(i)=\\frac{\\exp(s_i)}{\\sum_{j=1}^{n}\\exp(s_j)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5571em;vertical-align:-1.1301em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3057em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1301em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>理想分布由真实相关标签同样算出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>P</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P^*(i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，损失是两分布的交叉熵：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>ListNet</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msup><mi>P</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{ListNet}}=-\\sum_{i=1}^{n} P^*(i)\\log P(i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ListNet</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这等价于在整条列表上做 softmax 分类——让相关文档在「谁该排第一」的竞争中胜出。它天然考虑了所有文档的相对关系，比 pairwise 多了全局视角。许多现代稠密检索和重排训练里的 InfoNCE/对比损失，本质就是这个 softmax 列表损失的变体：把正例当唯一正类，一批难负例当其余类别，最大化正例的归一化分数。所以 <a href=\"hard-negatives-distillation\">难负样本与蒸馏</a> 里的难负，正是喂进这个 softmax 分母的对抗项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"lambdarank-直接朝-ndcg-优化\">LambdaRank：直接朝 nDCG 优化</h2><p>ListNet 对齐的是「排序的概率」，但还不是 nDCG 本身。LambdaRank 更进一步，直接把 nDCG 的影响塞进梯度。它的洞见是：与其定义一个可导的损失再求梯度，不如直接定义梯度（称为 lambda）。对一对文档 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(i,j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其交换梯度在 RankNet 基础上乘一个权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mtext>nDCG</mtext><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\Delta\\text{nDCG}_{ij}|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nDCG</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>——交换这两个文档会让 nDCG 变化多少：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mtext>nDCG</mtext><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{ij}=\\frac{-1}{1+\\exp\\big(s_i-s_j\\big)}\\cdot \\big|\\Delta\\text{nDCG}_{ij}\\big|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4114em;vertical-align:-1.09em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.26em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.09em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nDCG</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这一项是关键：把顶部排错（交换会大幅改变 nDCG）的梯度放大，把底部无关紧要的排错梯度缩小。于是模型把优化精力集中在用户真正看到的前几位，正好对齐 <a href=\"../practice/reranking-evaluation\">nDCG/MRR</a> 的「顶部敏感」特性。LambdaMART 是 LambdaRank 套在梯度提升树上的版本，长期是排序学习（<a href=\"../foundations/relevance-signals\">相关性信号</a> 里提到的 LTR）的工业基线之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三类目标怎么选\">三类目标怎么选</h2><p>实践中不必纠结理论最优，按数据形态和算力选。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n<th>对齐 nDCG</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pairwise (RankNet)</td>\n<td>成对偏好</td>\n<td>弱（错位等权）</td>\n<td>数据少、实现简单、起步基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ListNet / softmax</td>\n<td>列表概率分布</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>神经重排主流、配难负天然契合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LambdaRank / LambdaMART</td>\n<td>按 nDCG 增益加权梯度</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>看重顶部精度、有特征工程的 LTR</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对神经交叉编码器，softmax/InfoNCE 列表损失是当下主流——它实现简单、和难负样本机制无缝衔接、效果好。对有大量人工特征的传统 LTR 系统，LambdaMART 仍是强基线。追求极致顶部精度且能承受复杂度时，上 LambdaRank 风格的指标加权。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[选列表级目标] --&gt; B{神经重排器?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C{有难负样本管线?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[softmax/InfoNCE 列表损失]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[先建难负 再上列表损失]&#10;  B --&gt;|否 传统特征 LTR| F[LambdaMART]&#10;  A --&gt; G{极致顶部精度?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[LambdaRank 指标加权梯度]\">graph TD\n  A[选列表级目标] --&gt; B{神经重排器?}\n  B --&gt;|是| C{有难负样本管线?}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[softmax/InfoNCE 列表损失]\n  C --&gt;|否| E[先建难负 再上列表损失]\n  B --&gt;|否 传统特征 LTR| F[LambdaMART]\n  A --&gt; G{极致顶部精度?}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[LambdaRank 指标加权梯度]</pre><h2 id=\"与评测的闭环\">与评测的闭环</h2><p>列表级目标存在的全部理由，是让训练损失和评测指标指向同一个方向。所以它和评测是一枚硬币的两面：选了 nDCG@10 当上线指标，训练就该用对齐 nDCG 的列表损失，而不是和它脱节的 pointwise 二分类。否则会出现「训练 loss 一直降、nDCG 却不涨」的经典脱节。这个闭环怎么量化、怎么避免评测陷阱，是 <a href=\"../practice/reranking-evaluation\">评测 nDCG/MRR</a> 的主题；而列表损失依赖的难负样本从哪来，回到 <a href=\"hard-negatives-distillation\">难负样本与蒸馏</a>。三篇训练文档到此合龙：流程、数据、目标各司其职，共同决定一个重排器的上限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Pairwise 损失平等惩罚所有错位，与「只在乎顶部」的 nDCG/MRR 脱节；列表级目标弥合这道裂缝。</li>\n<li>ListNet 把排序转成 top-1 softmax 概率分布、用交叉熵对齐，现代神经重排的 InfoNCE/对比损失是其变体。</li>\n<li>LambdaRank 直接定义梯度，给成对梯度乘 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>nDCG</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\Delta\\text{nDCG}|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nDCG</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 权重，把优化精力集中到顶部；LambdaMART 是其树模型版。</li>\n<li>选型：神经重排用 softmax/InfoNCE（与难负无缝衔接），传统特征 LTR 用 LambdaMART，极致顶部用 LambdaRank。</li>\n<li>列表目标与评测是闭环：上线看哪个指标，训练就用对齐该指标的损失，避免「loss 降但 nDCG 不涨」。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"training-rerankers\">重排器训练</a> —— pointwise/pairwise 与本篇的关系。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"hard-negatives-distillation\">难负样本与蒸馏</a> —— softmax 列表损失分母里的难负。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../practice/reranking-evaluation\">评测 nDCG/MRR</a> —— 列表目标对齐的那个指标。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../ai-search-retrieval/ranking-models/learning-to-rank\">排序学习</a> —— LambdaMART 的 LTR 谱系。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../ai-evaluation-benchmarks/evaluation-fundamentals/evaluation-principles\">评估原则</a> —— 训练-评测对齐的方法论。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"列表级目标","id":"列表级目标"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从成对到列表","id":"核心概念-从成对到列表"},{"level":2,"text":"ListNet：把排序变成概率分布","id":"listnet-把排序变成概率分布"},{"level":2,"text":"LambdaRank：直接朝 nDCG 优化","id":"lambdarank-直接朝-ndcg-优化"},{"level":2,"text":"三类目标怎么选","id":"三类目标怎么选"},{"level":2,"text":"与评测的闭环","id":"与评测的闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"难负样本与蒸馏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reranking-retrieval-models/training/hard-negatives-distillation"},"next":{"title":"评测 nDCG/MRR","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/reranking-retrieval-models/practice/reranking-evaluation"}}